    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7970" root="حسر" body-key="H">
    
      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انحسر</span></b>  <i>It became removed, put off, taken
off,</i> or <i>stripped off,</i> from a thing which it covered
or concealed; (S, A, Mgh, Msb;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَسَرَ</span></b> ,
(K,) which occurs in poetry, (TA,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُسُورٌ</span>.
(K.) [See also 5.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>It</i> (the darkness) <i>became
removed,</i> or <i>cleared away;</i> (A, Msb;) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَنْهُ</span> [<i>from
him,</i> or <i>it</i>]. (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also 1: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  and 2.

